mber/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T17:25:21-07:00","id":1302687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1302537-contagion-chronicle-interview-with-matthew-dawkins?p=1302685#post1302685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Something weird happened with Matthew's audio feed during the recording.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, that explains it. Well, at least I can still clearly understand what he's saying. I'm listening to the podcast now. Good stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","name":"Ventrue Life","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24044_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T18:12:31-07:00","id":1302700,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m glad you like it and hope you stick around!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T19:07:20-07:00","id":1302713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ventrue Life</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1302537-contagion-chronicle-interview-with-matthew-dawkins?p=1302679#post1302679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What happened to the audio? Matthew Dawkins sounds like he turned into the Incredibly Hulk in this podcast!<br /> <br /> Did someone (accidentally) lower the pitch of the audio during the editing?</div> </div> </div> </div> So it wasn't just me hearing that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-04T19:12:44-07:00","id":1302716,"title":"","content":"Beyond Metal Growl Matthew, there's a lot of interesting insights in there. Apparently, he feels the Crucible Initiative is more Walter White than Fighting Fire with Fire; their end goals are ultimately selfish and all about destroying everything they despise with the Contagion, not just the Contagion itself. And I feel massively vindicated when Nalfgar's Army is explicitly called a 40K Chaos Cult; they even have the Norscan aesthetic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-05T01:48:37-07:00","id":1302762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1302537-contagion-chronicle-interview-with-matthew-dawkins?p=1302716#post1302716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beyond Metal Growl Matthew, there's a lot of interesting insights in there. Apparently, he feels the Crucible Initiative is more Walter White than Fighting Fire with Fire; their end goals are ultimately selfish and all about destroying everything they despise with the Contagion, not just the Contagion itself. And I feel massively vindicated when Nalfgar's Army is explicitly called a 40K Chaos Cult; they even have the Norscan aesthetic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Saying they're Fighting Fire with Fire is fair as well, but I may have my view tainted somewhat by a Crucible Initiative character I saw in a playtest, who was very much channelling her Heisenberg.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-05T02:44:45-07:00","id":1302767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1302537-contagion-chronicle-interview-with-matthew-dawkins?p=1302716#post1302716\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">he feels the Crucible Initiative is more Walter White than Fighting Fire with Fire; their end goals are ultimately selfish and all about destroying everything they despise with the Contagion, not just the Contagion itself. And I feel massively vindicated when Nalfgar's Army is explicitly called a 40K Chaos Cult; they even have the Norscan aesthetic.</div> </div> </div> </div>For some reason I like this a lot better. That characterization of the Crucible Initiative makes it a lot easier to see why they might work with other False (not often, but the PCs) and easier to have fun playing as one. The False have this &quot;I am a genius! OH NO!&quot; feel I love.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Gentleman Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1302537-contagion-chronicle-interview-with-matthew-dawkins?p=1302762#post1302762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Saying they're Fighting Fire with Fire is fair as well, but I may have my view tainted somewhat by a Crucible Initiative character I saw in a playtest, who was very much channelling her Heisenberg.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the mechanics strike me as leading to that as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11876,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","user":"Deinos","date":". 04-05-2019, 09:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T07:43:39-07:00","id":1303074,"title":"","content":"Very good interview. Nice seeing all these hints for the other settings and the writers consideration on things. Very interested in the strech goals mentioned, though so far we haven't seen them yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}